Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.93,0:02:34.84,Botan,Botan,0,0,0,,郡上学姐能邀请我们真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.75,0:02:37.28,Ibuki,Ibuki,0,0,0,,嗯 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.11,0:02:43.59,Botan,Botan,0,0,0,,在企划展大展厅里的那个展品
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.06,0:02:46.69,Botan,Botan,0,0,0,,我好喜欢 不可爱吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.31,0:02:48.04,Ibuki,Ibuki,0,0,0,,玻璃做的那个？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.59,0:02:49.32,Botan,Botan,0,0,0,,对的对的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.65,0:02:53.03,Ibuki,Ibuki,0,0,0,,欸？ 我觉得有点吓人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.03,0:02:54.53,Botan,Botan,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.53,0:02:58.70,Botan,Botan,0,0,0,,昏暗房间里开了个大洞的那个才吓人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.70,0:03:00.16,Botan,Botan,0,0,0,,像是蓝洞一样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.70,0:03:00.16,注释,,0,0,0,,注：海底突然下沉形成的巨大深洞，因水深呈现深蓝色而得名，是罕见的自然地理现象
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.16,0:03:02.54,Ibuki,Ibuki,0,0,0,,是吗 那个看起来不是挺漂亮嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.54,0:03:04.04,Botan,Botan,0,0,0,,是吗~
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.04,0:03:05.83,Ibuki,Ibuki,0,0,0,,所以我想再去看一次
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.24,0:03:09.38,Botan,Botan,0,0,0,,真的吗 那再去看一次吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.38,0:03:12.63,Ibuki,Ibuki,0,0,0,,欸？ 去看的话有点…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.43,0:03:24.65,Chin-Lan,Chin-Lan,0,0,0,,不是 这个真的能算「艺术」吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.19,0:03:42.10,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,我啊 如果没有事先了解就去看作品的话
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.58,0:03:44.41,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,经常会看太不懂呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.59,0:03:51.58,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,为什么这部作品会获得这么高的评价？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.41,0:03:55.77,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,作者在里面到底寄托了怎样的深意？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.21,0:04:00.59,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,因为太想知道这些
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.76,0:04:05.35,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,结果就会读很多评论和采访
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.06,0:04:10.10,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,但回过头想想 这算不算是一种「绕远路」呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.43,0:04:14.07,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,明明作品本身就在眼前
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.49,0:04:17.51,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,我却总想依赖别人的见解 没能纯粹地去欣赏它
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.66,0:04:21.63,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,总觉得没有真正去面对自己的感受
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.40,0:04:26.12,Chin-Lan,Chin-Lan,0,0,0,,虽然我觉得这是很正常的鉴赏方式
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.67,0:04:30.58,Chin-Lan,Chin-Lan,0,0,0,,我也看不懂这些东西
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.62,0:04:35.03,Chin-Lan,Chin-Lan,0,0,0,,看不懂的时候借助「辅助线」不是很正常吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.28,0:04:42.22,Chin-Lan,Chin-Lan,0,0,0,,看起来不像被说服的表情呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.66,0:04:46.40,Chin-Lan,Chin-Lan,0,0,0,,我要去常设展那边看看
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.38,0:04:48.51,Chin-Lan,Chin-Lan,0,0,0,,学姐你呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.52,0:04:50.42,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,我也去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.31,0:05:06.20,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,不…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.28,0:05:11.21,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,我再在这里看一会儿
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.49,0:05:14.38,Chin-Lan,Chin-Lan,0,0,0,,这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.11,0:05:16.46,Chin-Lan,Chin-Lan,0,0,0,,那 慢慢欣赏
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.54,0:05:19.80,Chin-Lan,Chin-Lan,0,0,0,,啊 对了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.39,0:05:25.38,Chin-Lan,Chin-Lan,0,0,0,,谢谢你今天带我过来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.96,0:05:27.67,Chin-Lan,Chin-Lan,0,0,0,,看艺术展 真是让人开心呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.57,0:05:32.98,Chin-Lan,Chin-Lan,0,0,0,,要是学姐… 也这样想就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.10,0:06:06.80,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,伊…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.40,0:06:28.94,Kanade,Kanade\Italic,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.40,0:06:31.03,Kanade,Kanade\Italic,0,0,0,,我做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.40,0:06:41.33,Kanade,Kanade\Italic,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.37,0:06:43.08,Kanade,Kanade\Italic,0,0,0,,不行的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.26,0:06:45.36,Kanade,Kanade\Italic,0,0,0,,我的那些东西
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.92,0:06:48.80,Kanade,Kanade\Italic,0,0,0,,根本不是什么「辅助线」
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.81,0:06:54.44,Kanade,Kanade\Italic,0,0,0,,而是被层层设下的「防线」
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.55,0:06:57.31,Kanade,Kanade\Italic,0,0,0,,因为...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.91,0:07:01.23,Kanade,Kanade\Italic,0,0,0,,我弄不懂啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.57,0:07:13.08,屏幕字,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\frz5.66\fax0.03\move(486,590,480,26,23,5487)\c&H524B47&}郡上学姐{\c&H564C48&}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.57,0:07:13.08,屏幕字,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\b0\c&H393434&\frz6\fax0.02\move(1040,852.01,1032,290.45,23,5489)}牡丹和伊吹是不是发生了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.57,0:07:13.08,屏幕字,,0,0,0,,{\fs50\c&H846B62&\fax0.03\frz5.319\move(1184,1338,1184,769)}已读
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.24,0:07:13.08,屏幕字,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\blur0.6\b0\c&H393434&\frz5.66\fax0.05\move(614.67,1110.53,608.67,730,25,3817)}不觉得吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.16,0:07:13.08,屏幕字,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\blur0.6\b0\c&H323932&\frz5.66\fax0.05\move(1560,1150.54,1558,856.01,25,2897)}不太好说
Dialogue: 1,0:07:11.04,0:07:12.55,Chin-Lan,Chin-Lan,0,0,0,,她太认真了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.09,0:07:23.26,屏幕字,,0,0,0,,{\frz5.66\fax0.05\move(878.66,118,878,-410.3,18,3491)\c&H6A6364&}牡丹和伊吹是不是发生了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.09,0:07:25.59,屏幕字,,0,0,0,,{\frz5.66\fax0.05\c&H5B5352&\move(500.68,498.68,500.68,-35.65,19,3473)}不觉得吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.09,0:07:25.59,屏幕字,,0,0,0,,{\b0\c&H3C473C&\frz5.66\fax0.05\move(1424.66,602.33,1422.66,67.03,19,3474)}不太好说
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.09,0:07:25.59,屏幕字,,0,0,0,,{\fs48\blur0.6\b0\c&HFCF7EF&\frz5.66\fax0.05\move(983.34,965.99,979.34,417.69,18,3480)}今天
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.09,0:07:25.59,屏幕字,,0,0,0,,{\frz5.66\fax0.05\move(1277.34,1200.64,1279.34,657.34,29,3480)\c&H323432&}今晚一起去喝酒吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.09,0:07:25.59,屏幕字,,0,0,0,,{\frz5.66\fax0.05\move(1413.33,1150.3,1421.33,926,29,1480)\c&H2E3430&}就我们两个
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.97,0:07:33.90,Chin-Lan,Chin-Lan,0,0,0,,不趁现在喝一杯还要等到什么时候呢 郡上学姐
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.49,0:07:58.31,Chin-Lan,Chin-Lan,0,0,0,,接下来呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.28,0:08:02.24,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,等…等等
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.24,0:08:03.63,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,让我先喝口水
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.31,0:08:06.40,Chin-Lan,Chin-Lan,0,0,0,,我会等的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.51,0:08:09.29,Chin-Lan,Chin-Lan,0,0,0,,多久都行
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.47,0:08:35.03,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,话说
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.42,0:08:38.16,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,今天在美术馆里你最喜欢的是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.08,0:08:39.83,Chin-Lan,Chin-Lan,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.87,0:08:41.74,Chin-Lan,Chin-Lan,0,0,0,,塞尚的画
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.87,0:08:41.74,注释,,0,0,0,,注：保罗·塞尚（1839-1906）法国后印象派画家 现代艺术先驱之一
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.92,0:08:45.29,Chin-Lan,Chin-Lan,0,0,0,,不… 能看到里希特的作品太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.92,0:08:45.29,注释,,0,0,0,,注：格哈德·里希特（Gerhard Richter，1932-）德国当代最具影响力的画家之一 也著有文集《绘画的日常实践：1962-1993年文集》
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.37,0:08:49.19,Chin-Lan,Chin-Lan,0,0,0,,因为以前我读过他写的书
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.94,0:08:53.30,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,是吗 答得真快呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.32,0:08:56.37,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,那 小景岚…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.12,0:09:01.69,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,你现在有喜欢的人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.31,0:09:04.19,Chin-Lan,Chin-Lan,0,0,0,,什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.48,0:09:07.69,Chin-Lan,Chin-Lan,0,0,0,,说什么呢 话题跳的也太快了…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.69,0:09:08.32,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.11,0:09:10.23,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,我决定接下来喝什么了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.79,0:09:13.95,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,呐 你喝一样的可以吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.83,0:09:15.70,Chin-Lan,Chin-Lan,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.34,0:09:19.06,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,这个来两杯 加冰
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.61,0:09:21.50,Chin-Lan,Chin-Lan,0,0,0,,那个 你在听我说话吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.40,0:09:24.52,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,在听在听 当然在听 接着聊吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.88,0:09:27.61,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,话说 刚才聊到哪里了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.55,0:09:30.47,Chin-Lan,Chin-Lan,0,0,0,,有哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.87,0:09:34.14,Chin-Lan,Chin-Lan,0,0,0,,喜欢你哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.39,0:09:40.69,路人,Bartender,0,0,0,,你们的信州苦艾酒
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.49,0:09:47.23,Chin-Lan,Chin-Lan,0,0,0,,信州苦艾酒？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.24,0:09:49.59,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,标签不可爱吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.28,0:09:51.24,Chin-Lan,Chin-Lan,0,0,0,,可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.24,0:09:54.24,屏幕字,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.2\fs36\c&H2A6193&\frz-35.87\pos(802,772)}来自南信州献给梵高的礼物
Dialogue: 1,0:09:51.94,0:09:54.84,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,有个小女孩 在给梵高递向日葵
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.74,0:09:57.87,Chin-Lan,Chin-Lan,0,0,0,,今天 也看了梵高的画呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.24,0:09:59.04,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.45,0:10:06.36,Chin-Lan,Chin-Lan,0,0,0,,啊 多么令人愉悦的香气啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.03,0:10:11.33,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,舌头有温和的刺激感
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.74,0:10:13.00,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,但也能尝到甜味
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.89,0:10:15.49,Chin-Lan,Chin-Lan,0,0,0,,嗯 很好入口
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.24,0:10:18.26,Chin-Lan,Chin-Lan,0,0,0,,梵高喝了也会高兴吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.88,0:10:21.75,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,梵高喜欢喝苦艾酒吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.88,0:10:21.75,注释,,0,0,0,,注：梵高是苦艾酒的著名爱好者 苦艾酒的高醇含量和侧柏酮成分曾被认为与他的精神疾病有关
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.40,0:10:23.98,Chin-Lan,Chin-Lan,0,0,0,,诶 这不是很有名吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.58,0:10:26.91,Chin-Lan,Chin-Lan,0,0,0,,你看 罗特列克他们也喝
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.58,0:10:26.91,注释,,0,0,0,,注：罗特列克（ Toulouse-Lautrec，1864-1901）同为后印象派画家 也是巴黎蒙马特苦艾酒文化的代表
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.25,0:10:29.36,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,是吗 我还不知道呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.29,0:10:33.68,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,我对梵高只有那部电影的印象
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.51,0:10:36.83,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,你知道吧 就是柯克·道格拉斯的那部…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.51,0:10:36.83,注释,,0,0,0,,注：柯克·道格拉斯版——《梵高传》（Lust for Life 1956）\N柯克·道格拉斯主演 讲述梵高生平的好莱坞经典传记片
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.29,0:10:38.41,Chin-Lan,Chin-Lan,0,0,0,,老电影？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.41,0:10:39.87,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,对 老电影！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.77,0:10:43.23,Chin-Lan,Chin-Lan,0,0,0,,我只看了奥特曼的那部
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.77,0:10:45.06,注释,,0,0,0,,注：奥特曼版——《梵高与提奥》（Vincent & Theo 1990）\N罗伯特·奥特曼（Robert Altman 1925-2006）执导，代表作《陆军野战医院》（M*A*S*H 1970）\N本片由蒂姆·罗斯（Tim Roth）饰演梵高
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.88,0:10:45.06,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,拍「陆军野战医院」的那个奥特曼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.57,0:10:46.47,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,他居然也拍过梵高啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.93,0:10:49.84,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,奥特曼版的主演是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.84,0:10:50.96,Chin-Lan,Chin-Lan,0,0,0,,蒂姆·罗斯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.84,0:10:50.96,注释,,0,0,0,,注：蒂姆·罗斯（Tim Roth，1961—）\N英国演员、导演
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.96,0:10:54.93,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,啊 原来如此 我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.93,0:11:00.35,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,罗斯主演的话 我最喜欢托纳多雷的「海上钢琴师」了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.93,0:11:00.35,注释,,0,0,0,,注：托纳多雷《海上钢琴师》\N朱塞佩·托纳多雷（Giuseppe Tornatore）执导 蒂姆·罗斯主演的经典电影（1998）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.35,0:11:01.81,Chin-Lan,Chin-Lan,0,0,0,,我更喜欢「落水狗」
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.35,0:11:04.23,注释,,0,0,0,,注：《落水狗》（Reservoir Dogs 1992）\N昆汀·塔伦蒂诺处女作 蒂姆·罗斯参演
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.81,0:11:04.23,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,「落水狗」啊 我懂的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.81,0:11:06.52,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,还有 斯托帕德的那部…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.81,0:11:06.52,注释,,0,0,0,,注：斯托帕德版——《君臣人子小命呜呼》（Rosencrantz & Guildenstern Are Dead 1990）\N汤姆·斯托帕德（Tom Stoppard）自编自导 蒂姆·罗斯与加里·奥德曼联袂主演
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.57,0:11:12.98,Chin-Lan,Chin-Lan,0,0,0,,斯托帕德的…？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.07,0:11:15.07,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,现在...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.81,0:11:18.41,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,现在我 真的…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.03,0:11:26.75,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,你说 我该怎么办啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.69,0:11:30.59,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,和你在一起感觉很安心
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.20,0:11:32.11,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,也很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.71,0:11:35.61,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,但这点让我有些害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.53,0:11:44.64,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,现在 我的内心像暴风雨之夜一样躁动不安
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.39,0:11:48.10,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,又黑 又让人害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.67,0:11:51.19,Chin-Lan,Chin-Lan,0,0,0,,大海固然险恶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.76,0:11:53.12,Chin-Lan,Chin-Lan,0,0,0,,风暴也确实恐怖
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.15,0:11:56.12,Chin-Lan,Chin-Lan,0,0,0,,这些 渔夫们比谁都清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.85,0:12:10.58,Chin-Lan,Chin-Lan,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.12,0:12:15.09,Chin-Lan,Chin-Lan,0,0,0,,危险绝不能成为不出海的理由
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.06,0:12:31.77,Chin-Lan,Chin-Lan,0,0,0,,据说 这是梵高当年在信里写下的一句至理名言
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.06,0:12:31.77,注释,,0,0,0,,注：出自梵高1882年致弟弟提奥的信
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.93,0:12:36.11,Chin-Lan,Chin-Lan,0,0,0,,呐 学姐
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.78,0:12:40.03,Chin-Lan,Chin-Lan,0,0,0,,和我一起 出海吧
