Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.16,0:19:04.87,屏幕字,,0,0,0,,{\fad(980,1752)\fs30\fscx90\c&H4D4D4D&\fax-0.23\3c&HFEFDFB&\frz338.4\pos(1096.5,804)}好~
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.16,0:19:04.87,屏幕字,,0,0,0,,{\fad(980,1752)\fs25\c&H3C3C3C&\fax-0.23\fscx80\fscy80\frz338\pos(1102.5,833.5)}景岚
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.16,0:19:04.87,屏幕字,,0,0,0,,{\fad(980,1752)\fs30\fscx90\fax-0.13\3c&HFEFDFB&\frz338\pos(1033.5,888)\c&H414141&}OK了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.22,0:19:15.92,Botan,Botan,0,0,0,,理由？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.82,0:19:21.51,Ibuki,Ibuki,0,0,0,,因为不想回老家过正月
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.64,0:19:21.81,屏幕字,,0,0,0,,{\fn华康手札体W5-A\frz-29.07\fax-0.27\pos(942,505.5)\c&H43454B&\b1}家里寄了酒过来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.64,0:19:21.81,屏幕字,,0,0,0,,{\fn华康手札体W5-A\frz-29.07\fax-0.27\pos(824,599.5)\c&H3B3F43&\b1}大家随意享用
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.64,0:19:21.81,屏幕字,,0,0,0,,{\fn华康手札体W5-A\frz-29.07\fax-0.27\pos(958,839.5)\c&H2C2E32&\b1}八重花
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.33,0:19:24.78,Botan,Botan,0,0,0,,哈啊… 雪？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.14,0:19:25.84,Ibuki,Ibuki,0,0,0,,雪！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.41,0:19:30.74,Ibuki,Ibuki,0,0,0,,路不好走 又要被叫去铲雪 还冷得要死
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.14,0:19:32.68,Ibuki,Ibuki,0,0,0,,冬天真是坏文化
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.65,0:19:35.51,Botan,Botan,0,0,0,,才不是文化
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.51,0:19:37.61,Botan,Botan,0,0,0,,伊吹的老家 是在富山市吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.76,0:19:40.26,Ibuki,Ibuki,0,0,0,,不 还要再往西 过了庄川
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.25,0:19:44.07,Botan,Botan,0,0,0,,没概念
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.43,0:19:45.99,Ibuki,Ibuki,0,0,0,,也是呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.13,0:19:52.38,Ibuki,Ibuki,0,0,0,,牡丹回家的时候坐新干线吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.63,0:19:53.68,Botan,Botan,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.98,0:19:57.06,Botan,Botan,0,0,0,,我家在长野站以南很远 所以坐夜行大巴
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.63,0:19:59.41,Botan,Botan,0,0,0,,或者从八王子坐特急梓号
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.80,0:20:03.15,Ibuki,Ibuki,0,0,0,,刚好是八点整的那班♪~
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.80,0:20:03.15,注释,Ibuki,0,0,0,,注：「8時ちょうどの」是昭和名曲 「あずさ2号」的歌词梗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.25,0:20:06.30,Botan,Botan,0,0,0,,在说什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.58,0:20:07.13,Botan,Botan,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.62,0:20:09.87,Ibuki,Ibuki,0,0,0,,啊… 那个… 没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.65,0:20:16.70,Ibuki,Ibuki,0,0,0,,话说 从刚才就放在桌上的那个
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.13,0:20:18.29,Ibuki,Ibuki,0,0,0,,是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.68,0:20:19.10,Botan,Botan,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.54,0:20:21.80,Botan,Botan,0,0,0,,哦 你说这个啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.93,0:20:27.73,Botan,Botan,0,0,0,,八重花学姐好像说大家可以一起喝…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.32,0:20:31.33,Ibuki,Ibuki,0,0,0,,那不是「百年孤独」吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.32,0:20:31.33,注释,,0,0,0,,注：宫崎县黑木本店出品的麦烧酎。经白橡木桶长期熟成，呈琥珀色，酒精度40%，口感与香气接近威士忌。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.73,0:20:34.03,Akane,Akane,0,0,0,,早呀 两位
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.84,0:20:38.24,Akane,Akane,0,0,0,,牡丹房间里有手机在响 大概是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.58,0:20:40.09,Botan,Botan,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.72,0:20:42.07,Ibuki,Ibuki,0,0,0,,没事 你快去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.51,0:20:44.98,Botan,Botan,0,0,0,,抱歉 舍长…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.20,0:20:46.10,Ibuki,Ibuki,0,0,0,,去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.71,0:21:05.52,Akane,Akane,0,0,0,,喝点吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.00,0:21:08.29,Akane,Akane,0,0,0,,这个烧酒 我记得是好东西吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.78,0:21:10.20,Ibuki,Ibuki,0,0,0,,不对 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.39,0:21:12.38,Ibuki,Ibuki,0,0,0,,那个冰袋不是我的吗？！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.70,0:21:20.46,Akane,Akane,0,0,0,,分我点呗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.32,0:21:22.37,Ibuki,Ibuki,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.54,0:21:27.00,Chin-Lan,Chin-Lan,0,0,0,,这是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.92,0:21:31.49,Akane,Akane,0,0,0,,嗯… 是…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.94,0:21:33.00,Akane,Akane,0,0,0,,酒？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.03,0:21:35.47,Chin-Lan,Chin-Lan,0,0,0,,不 我说具体点…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.47,0:21:39.81,Akane,Akane,0,0,0,,哦 标签上写了好多英文
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.04,0:21:43.36,Chin-Lan,Chin-Lan,0,0,0,,「百年孤独」
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.96,0:21:45.00,Chin-Lan,Chin-Lan,0,0,0,,马尔克斯那个吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.18,0:21:46.83,Akane,Akane,0,0,0,,谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.37,0:21:53.71,Chin-Lan,Chin-Lan,0,0,0,,诺贝尔文学奖得主 你知道几个？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.27,0:21:56.06,Akane,Akane,0,0,0,,嘿嘿 村上春树！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.27,0:21:56.06,注释,Akane,0,0,0,,注：村上春树曾多次提名但未获诺贝尔文学奖
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.02,0:22:00.19,Chin-Lan,Chin-Lan,0,0,0,,我也去拿个杯子来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.29,0:22:07.13,Akane,Akane,0,0,0,,哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.44,0:22:09.05,Ibuki,Ibuki,0,0,0,,欸 什么 吓我一跳
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.97,0:22:12.95,Akane,Akane,0,0,0,,舍长 这烧酒超棒的！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.45,0:22:14.68,Akane,Akane,0,0,0,,When you hear music
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.45,0:22:19.47,注释,,0,0,0,,注：这句话出自埃里克·多尔菲生前最后一张录音专辑《Last Date》末尾
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.68,0:22:17.24,Akane,Akane,0,0,0,,after it's over  it's gone in the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.24,0:22:19.47,Akane,Akane,0,0,0,,You can never capture it again
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.47,0:22:22.63,Akane,Akane,0,0,0,,音乐一旦响起 结束后就消散在空中
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.63,0:22:24.36,Akane,Akane,0,0,0,,永远无法再次重现
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.14,0:22:28.76,Akane,Akane,0,0,0,,快看 这是埃里克·多尔菲的名言
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.14,0:22:28.76,注释,,0,0,0,,注：埃里克·多尔菲（Eric Dolphy） 美国爵士萨克斯手/长笛手
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.38,0:22:31.04,路人,Group,0,0,0,,谁啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.04,0:22:32.05,Akane,Akane,0,0,0,,不是吧？！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.31,0:22:35.67,Chin-Lan,Chin-Lan,0,0,0,,伊吹 我也要冰
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.00,0:22:37.14,Ibuki,Ibuki,0,0,0,,请请请~
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.81,0:22:38.72,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,他是干什么的？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.92,0:22:40.12,Akane,Akane,0,0,0,,玩爵士的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.39,0:22:42.69,Akane,Akane,0,0,0,,「Out to Lunch」没听过吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.39,0:22:42.69,注释,,0,0,0,,注：埃里克·多尔菲的代表作 被公认为前卫爵士的经典专辑
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.63,0:22:45.07,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,没…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.55,0:22:46.80,Akane,Akane,0,0,0,,真的假的~
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.81,0:22:51.29,Akane,Akane,0,0,0,,等一下 我现在就放给你听
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.48,0:22:53.05,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.95,0:22:55.50,Chin-Lan,Chin-Lan,0,0,0,,我开动了~
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.21,0:22:58.63,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,啊 我也想喝
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.19,0:23:01.13,Akane,Akane,0,0,0,,都说了马上放给你听！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.66,0:23:04.13,Chin-Lan,Chin-Lan,0,0,0,,用我的杯子可以吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.53,0:23:05.38,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,可以吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.30,0:23:07.97,Chin-Lan,Chin-Lan,0,0,0,,可以哦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.35,0:23:09.39,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,好耶！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.93,0:23:18.67,Chin-Lan,Chin-Lan,0,0,0,,这个威士忌好好喝
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.93,0:23:18.67,注释,,0,0,0,,注：「百年孤独」是木桶陈年麦烧酎 口感极似威士忌 这款酒在日本被称为 "烧酎界的威士忌"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.81,0:23:20.97,Kanade,Kanade,0,0,0,,那是烧酒
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.34,0:23:22.05,Chin-Lan,Chin-Lan,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.19,0:23:25.31,Botan,Botan,0,0,0,,哇 好热闹啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.31,0:23:26.69,Botan,Botan,0,0,0,,大家都在喝酒吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.07,0:23:29.43,Akane,Akane,0,0,0,,过来喝一杯嘛 小姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.36,0:23:31.39,路人,Group,0,0,0,,这是谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.59,0:23:34.02,Botan,Botan,0,600,0,,那我就不客气了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.12,0:23:34.02,Ibuki,Ibuki,600,0,0,,喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.48,0:23:35.87,Botan,Botan,0,600,0,,我开动了~
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.48,0:23:39.61,Ibuki,Ibuki,600,0,0,,给我留点啊~
